# Laravel Core

This is a Laravel 13 + Livewire 4 blank starter (standard layout, not DDD). Enforce these on every change.

## Architecture

- Thin controllers/Livewire: HTTP I/O only; put logic in Actions, Services, or Jobs
- No business logic in `routes/*.php`
- Prefer Eloquent until complexity justifies a repository
- Raw SQL / complex Query Builder: `app/Repositories/` only (interface + Eloquent impl)
- Use Form Requests for non-trivial validation; `$request->validated()` + `$fillable`
- Casts via `casts()` method (not `$casts` property)
- Middleware / bootstrap: `bootstrap/app.php` (slim skeleton)

## Style & Tooling

- PSR-12 via Pint (`composer lint` / `composer lint:check`)
- PHPStan/Larastan level 7 (`composer types:check`)
- Tests with Pest (`composer test` or `php artisan test`)
- Frontend tooling: **bun** only — never npm/nodejs

## Feedback When Reviewing

| Level | When |
|-------|------|
| Critical | Security, data loss, broken behavior |
| Suggestion | Performance, maintainability, convention |
| Nice to have | Optional polish |

## Version Notes

- Laravel 11+ slim skeleton applies; do not recreate `Http/Kernel.php`
- Livewire 4 components under `app/Livewire/`
